  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening agro-climatic monitoring and information systems to improve adaptation to climate change and food security in Lao PDR (FSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to government&apos;s priority to fulfill three targets of the Seventh National Socio Economic Development Plan (2011 / 2015)   which are the following:
Achievement of the Millennium Development Goals by 2015;
Adoption of appropriate technology, skills and create favorable conditions for graduating the country from LDC by 2020;
Sustainable development by emphasizing economic development with, cultural and social progress, preserving natural resources and protecting the environment.</narrative>
  </description>
